      "en": "Again I lifted up my eyes, and saw, and behold, four chariots came out from between two mountains; and the mountains were mountains of bronze.",
      "ko": "내가 또 눈을 들어본즉 네 병거가 두 산 사이에서 나왔는데 그 산은 놋산이더라",
      "source_text_hash": "7dd9a4714165fb5f71755c169eec5842f09d153513e6099f1dea2648c099e08a",
      "translation_text_hash": "2558f568671b296269c07066d4a7cc81fe1f0e82ad206d192023ccae16e33364",
