      "en": "In the first chariot were red horses. In the second chariot were black horses.",
      "ko": "첫째 병거는 홍마들이, 둘째 병거는 흑마들이,",
      "source_text_hash": "1ec3544625e099e7151bc212f3c95bcbe547e0569d75d2822a58770c0415ac90",
      "translation_text_hash": "08c4850f0dfacb0d2f1bbc42529dc2f4c914aed5c50fa1188ffad5247ce3b7ea",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
