      "en": "In the third chariot were white horses. In the fourth chariot were dappled horses, all of them powerful.",
      "ko": "세째 병거는 백마들이, 네째 병거는 어룽지고 건장한 말들이 메었는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "336a1ee38050d26f1db36d66e90dc80a6cbef92444e1422be53de1bd5e5778f9",
      "translation_text_hash": "69a584dec104f05be7efec6e6888b78dea85422bbd1431e64d995aa082d56d13",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "세째 병거는 백마들이, 네째 병거는 어룽지고 건장한 말들이 메었는지라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "69a584dec104f05be7efec6e6888b78dea85422bbd1431e64d995aa082d56d13"
      ]
