      "en": "The one with the black horses goes out toward the north country; and the white went out after them; and the dappled went out toward the south country.”",
      "ko": "흑마는 북편 땅으로 나가매 백마가 그 뒤를 따르고 어룽진 말은 남편 땅으로 나가고",
      "source_text_hash": "bcb6cbaa60e2942d11653851ad3e59a314a1925c822e9a933f41f0be2814dd80",
      "translation_text_hash": "e119dbbf0711a574096acd6c45cb5ec6c1d28d92af7d98eb66790c3d8c991d2a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "흑마는 북편 땅으로 나가매 백마가 그 뒤를 따르고 어룽진 말은 남편 땅으로 나가고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "e119dbbf0711a574096acd6c45cb5ec6c1d28d92af7d98eb66790c3d8c991d2a"
